Date: Wed, 11 Nov 2026 22:54:41 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] umi: GPU (0282): a hung 3D core is reset and goes on
 (watchdog, SW reset, pending submissions dropped); SMMU faults logged +
 cleared, no longer 'device lost' for every client; submit walk visits each
 page once (8 -> 2 ms per submit); only changed page tables flushed per
 map/unmap; page-table slots 8192 + window reuse (0253, was uncommitted);
 frame-time and submit-part lines; A650 clock gating opt-in (sweetgpuhwcg=1,
 untested)

Co-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5.2 <noreply@anthropic.com>
